    effective_date:'Pending final rule — consultation closes 2026-10-18', deadline:'2026-10-18',
    what_changed:'DISR released a consultation draft proposing to make ten AI guardrails legally binding for organisations developing or deploying high-risk AI. The guardrails were previously aspirational under the Voluntary AI Safety Standard (February 2024). The consultation proposes binding effect via amendments to the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act for entities with more than A$50M annual turnover operating in designated high-risk sectors.',
