    risk_category:'National AI governance',
    effective_date:'2027-01-01', deadline:'2027-01-01',
    what_changed:"China's National Institute of Standardization published GB/T 44464-2026, the first Chinese national standard for safety testing and evaluation of large language models. Effective 1 January 2027 for voluntary compliance, with mandatory compliance expected through CAC rulemaking referencing the standard by Q3 2027. The standard defines 68 safety evaluation dimensions across six categories and introduces CNEVAL-LLM, a standardised benchmark suite.",
