    standfirst:'ESMA’s May 2024 public statement makes the position clear: investment firms that use AI when serving retail clients remain subject to all applicable MiFID II requirements — organisational obligations, conduct-of-business duties, and the obligation to act in the client’s best interests. AI is not a compliance shortcut. The statement is guidance on existing obligations, not a new standalone AI rule.',
